{"overview":"Three childhood friends, Martha, Walter and Sam, share a terrible secret. Over time, the ambitious Martha and the pusillanimous Walter have married. She is a cold businesswoman; he is the district attorney: a perfect combination to dominate the corrupt city of Iverstown at will. But the unexpected return of Sam, after years of absence, deeply disturbs the life of the odd couple.","tagline":"Fate drew them together… and only murder could part them!","cast":[{"n":"Barbara Stanwyck","c":"Martha Ivers","p":"/xBfikc66lCnShogMZX1k9cV7H26.jpg","q":"Q94002"},{"n":"Van Heflin","c":"Sam Masterson","p":"/8YDZWDaX9lp1GUTdRzokngoLd8s.jpg","q":"Q350678"},{"n":"Lizabeth Scott","c":"Antonia 'Toni' Marachek","p":"/jOEqWNlan6BECy0qQiE9CLxHrRb.jpg","q":"Q264011"},{"n":"Kirk Douglas","c":"Walter O'Neil","p":"/t94It9bPI6uBvNuuQlQipyYyURC.jpg","q":"Q104027"},{"n":"Judith Anderson","c":"Mrs. Ivers","p":"/33Ree0GhYJoxQuh1vAjyGsoKiS4.jpg","q":"Q230415"},{"n":"Roman Bohnen","c":"Mr. O'Neil","p":"/4X6DJ6peH7Q095HNGNtdQks5IG2.jpg","q":"Q3440829"},{"n":"Darryl Hickman","c":"Young Sam","p":"/jdIFmbz3nxAueHTQufGbLdDTDfQ.jpg","q":"Q3016561"},{"n":"Janis Wilson","c":"Young Martha","p":"/xxK2t7bNeC4f6b5epdfV5ezyKUg.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Ann Doran","c":"Bobbi St. John","p":"/t6q0svIGjotyJQgxr74pKz6462g.jpg","q":"Q450047"},{"n":"Frank Orth","c":"Hotel Clerk","p":"/s8yUbtAu6wueQjDRncuSX6x6ZUt.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Strange_Love_of_Martha_Ivers","qid":"Q971265"}